		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>60-foot-long, sleek, whip-thin dragon made from tangible darkness. Delight in killing.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 15, <strong>HP</strong> 62, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 rend +8 (2d8) or 1 shadow breath, <strong>MV</strong> double near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +5, <strong>D</strong> -1, <strong>C</strong> +4, <strong>I</strong> +2, <strong>W</strong> +3, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 13</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Shadow Breath</strong>. A double near-size cube of enervating blackness extending from dragon. CON 15+ or 4d8 damage. Mortal creatures reduced to 0 HP die, rise as shadows in 1d4 rounds.</p><p></p><p><strong>Shadowblood</strong>. Can harm incorporeal creatures. Inspires fear in undead.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
